@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction

rectangle "fake-serial\n(TCP server :7000)" as Fake
rectangle "qr-c container" as QRC {
  rectangle "socat\nTCP -> PTY" as Socat
  rectangle "PTY device\n/tmp/ttyS1\n(local to qr-c)" as PTY
  rectangle "C++ app\nJobRunner reads frames\n(COBS + 0x00 delimiter)" as App
}

Fake --> Socat : TCP byte stream\n(COBS frames)
Socat --> PTY : creates local PTY\nand writes bytes
App --> PTY : open/read /tmp/ttyS1

note right of PTY
PTY nodes live in /dev/pts (devpts)
and are namespaced per container.

Do NOT share /tmp/ttyS1 via volume
from another container.
end note

@enduml
